      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- easy setup via environment variables: API Key, base URL, secrets\n- connects and listens SSE\n- downloads feature flags on init\n- initializes local cache with feature flags downloaded\n- receives updates from the Primary server or from the Edge by SSE, revalidates the local cache\n- in case of network partitioning SDK fallsback to the local in-memory cache",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- easy setup via environment variables: API Key, base URL, secrets\n- connects and listens SSE\n- downloads feature flags on init\n- initializes local cache with feature flags downloaded\n- receives updates from the Primary server or from the Edge by SSE, revalidates the local cache\n- in case of network partitioning SDK fallsback to the local in-memory cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
